  "_id": "DragonrazerItem0",
  "name": "Dragonrazer",
  "type": "weapon",
  "img": "icons/weapons/artillery/cannon-engraved-gold.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Size</strong> Large; <strong>Armor Class</strong> 19; <strong>Hit Points</strong> 100</p>\n<p><strong>Damage Immunities</strong> poison; psychic; all damage that isn't siege damage</p>\n<p>A Dragonrazer is a large cannon that uses dragonrazer fuel cells to propel a large explosive harpoon through the air at destructive speeds.</p>\n<p>A dragonrazer is supported on a large swiveling metal platform. Before it can be fired, the dragonrazer must be loaded with two fuel cells (75 lbs each) and aimed. It takes one action to load each full cell, one action to aim it, and one action to fire it.</p>\n<p><strong>Fire:</strong> +8 to hit, range 150/600 ft., one target. Hit: 27 (5d10) piercing damage and the harpoon explodes. Miss: the harpoon lands 1d8 spaces away in a random direction, then explodes. Creatures in a 20-foot-radius sphere make a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw, taking 28 (8d6) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>Use <strong>Load Fuel Cell</strong> twice, then <strong>Aim</strong>, then <strong>Fire</strong>. Resolve the explosion with <strong>Harpoon Explosion</strong>.</p>\n<p><em>Source: AGMH p.83</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Dragonrazer</strong> — load ×2, aim, fire (+8 / 5d10), then explosion (DC 15 Dex, 8d6 fire).</p>"
    },
